OL,3,GNEWSAMP opposes plan for asylum seeker
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has spoken out against plans to
OL,7,Fuse a prominent block of flats in his
OL,8,Ftown to house asylum seekers.
OL,10,FDr Simon Opher said Stroud's Tricorn
OL,11,FHouse, which has been recently
OL,12,Frenovated after standing derelict for
OL,13,Fmore than two decades, should instead
OL,14,Fbe offered to local homeless people.
OL,16,FThe Labour MP said the owner of the
OL,17,Fbuilding, Vilednik Holdings, approached
OL,18,Fthe Home Office and offered it up as a
OL,19,Flocation for those fleeing war,
OL,20,Fpersecution and the threat of violence.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
