OL,3,GNEWSAMP opposes plan for asylum seeker
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government would not confirm the
OL,7,Fdetails of its discussions about
OL,8,FTricorn House, but said it will work
OL,9,Fwith local communities housing asylum
OL,10,Fseekers. The BBC is attempting to
OL,11,Fcontact Vilednik Holdings for comment.
